    "survival_factor": "(1-p_s)(1-p_d) = exp(-(lambda_s+lambda_d)D): correct for the probability that NEITHER event occurs, under independent latent times. NOT the same as 1-p_s-p_d, which would be right only if the two marginal event probabilities were mutually exclusive.",
